</div></header>

<main class="wrap">
<section class="hero"><div class="hgrid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Struck in low quantity · Series IV</div>
<h1>Coins that outlive<br>the <em>context window</em>.</h1>
<p class="lede">WastedToken Mint strikes physical challenge coins for people who burn compute for a
living. Solid alloy, 3.2&nbsp;mm thick, reeded edge, numbered on the rim. Every token you ever
wasted, pressed into something you can actually hold.</p>
<div class="cta">
<button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('collection').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">View the collection</button>
